{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Zombiology",
    "steam_appid": 2896730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.poster.avif?t=1748356341\" width=650 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.webm?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.mp4?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need your help to figure out the missing genetic code to build vital cellular parts. String lively amino building blocks into lots of unique shapes. Some are straight rectangles, some are 90-degree turns, others are circles that allow rotation, or stretchy springs. By combining different strings of these shapes together you can create a larger shape that uniquely fits into the level to solve a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/54547ff4996bab5c22de40e0de0f346c.poster.avif?t=1748356341\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/54547ff4996bab5c22de40e0de0f346c.webm?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the hang of it, you'll soon be combining simple shapes into more interesting ones to help mend broken bones, ward of nasty viruses and just plain grow! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/e6e5c2c82edb54bf663d115bf96af440.avif?t=1748356341\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a mad scientist to create unique molecule solutions to each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dozens of unique levels with various mechanics and biomes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover tons of different amino building blocks to help solve puzzles </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.poster.avif?t=1748356341\" width=650 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.webm?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/1bb2aed104bebd3ad324a3bdcac9f9cf.mp4?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need your help to figure out the missing genetic code to build vital cellular parts. String lively amino building blocks into lots of unique shapes. Some are straight rectangles, some are 90-degree turns, others are circles that allow rotation, or stretchy springs. By combining different strings of these shapes together you can create a larger shape that uniquely fits into the level to solve a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/54547ff4996bab5c22de40e0de0f346c.poster.avif?t=1748356341\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/54547ff4996bab5c22de40e0de0f346c.webm?t=1748356341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the hang of it, you'll soon be combining simple shapes into more interesting ones to help mend broken bones, ward of nasty viruses and just plain grow! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896730/extras/e6e5c2c82edb54bf663d115bf96af440.avif?t=1748356341\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a mad scientist to create unique molecule solutions to each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dozens of unique levels with various mechanics and biomes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover tons of different amino building blocks to help solve puzzles </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover the fun of zombie genetics in this physics based puzzle game. Explore dozens of levels in the micro-cosmos, as you combine simple shapes into complex molecules to help mend broken bones, ward off nasty viruses, and revive cells.",
